  "actual_dialogues": [
    {
      "start": 1.2,
      "end": 3.1,
      "film_at": 2.16,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Magnificent.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N太精彩了"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.1,
      "end": 6.24,
      "film_at": 4.68,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Sealed in style by Paolini.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N帕奥利尼漂亮收官"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.28,
      "end": 9.5,
      "film_at": 8.4,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}And what has been a season of struggle,{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N在这个一路艰难的赛季"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.62,
      "end": 13.54,
      "film_at": 12.08,
      "subtitle_bottom": "480",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}a much-needed win for the Italian.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N意大利人拿到急需的一胜"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.89,
      "end": 15.6,
      "film_at": 14.76,
      "subtitle_bottom": "361",
      "text": "{\\an2}帕奥利尼赢下两盘"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.6,
      "end": 17.87,
      "film_at": 16.72,
      "subtitle_bottom": "361",
      "text": "{\\an2}过程却并不轻松"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.89,
      "end": 22.44,
      "film_at": 20.68,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}北京时间{\\fs78}10{\\fs68}月{\\fs78}12{\\fs68}日下午 武汉首轮"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.44,
      "end": 25.13,
      "film_at": 23.8,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}帕奥利尼迎战贝莱克"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.23,
      "end": 30.55,
      "film_at": 29.4,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Lovely. Yeah, that is what Paolini does.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N漂亮 这就是帕奥利尼"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.55,
      "end": 33.45,
      "film_at": 32.0,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Such a gorgeous touch. Oh!{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N手感太细腻了 哦"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.94,
      "end": 45.74,
      "film_at": 43.84,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Oh, she dug that out ever so well. Tough one.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N哦 这球救得太好了 不好打"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.66,
      "end": 50.36,
      "film_at": 48.52,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}It's got work to do for it to be in this game.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N还需要努力 才能留在这一局"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.49,
      "end": 53.02,
      "film_at": 51.76,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}帕奥利尼先冲到{\\fs78}4{\\fs68}比{\\fs78}0{\\fs68}"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.02,
      "end": 55.1,
      "film_at": 54.08,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}贝莱克在底线继续追击"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.1,
      "end": 57.93,
      "film_at": 56.52,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}把这一盘的悬念又拉了回来"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.98,
      "end": 64.95,
      "film_at": 63.48,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Oh, it's beautifully struck though. Fighting away here.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N这拍打得漂亮 她仍在拼搏"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.84,
      "end": 97.02000000000001,
      "film_at": 95.92,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Oh, long? No.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N哦 出界了吗？没有"
    },
    {
      "start": 98.18,
      "end": 100.68,
      "film_at": 99.44,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Well, Bejlek.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N贝莱克这一球"
    },
    {
      "start": 110.22,
      "end": 114.96000000000001,
      "film_at": 112.6,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}So quick, so athletic and so powerful.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N速度快 身体强 击球有力"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.06,
      "end": 123.91,
      "film_at": 120.0,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Threatened to come back, and she still might do just that.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N她展现反扑势头 仍可能追上"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.91,
      "end": 126.89,
      "film_at": 125.4,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Third set point. She has to take it.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N第三个盘点 她必须把握住"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.17,
      "end": 130.37,
      "film_at": 129.28,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Needs the first serve.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N她需要一发进球"
    },
    {
      "start": 130.89,
      "end": 133.38,
      "film_at": 132.12,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}贝莱克把比分追到{\\fs78}3{\\fs68}比{\\fs78}5{\\fs68}"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.38,
      "end": 135.39,
      "film_at": 134.4,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}帕奥利尼终于拿下盘点"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.39,
      "end": 137.8,
      "film_at": 136.6,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fs78}6{\\fs68}比{\\fs78}3{\\fs68} 先赢一盘"
    },
    {
      "start": 147.84,
      "end": 151.57999999999998,
      "film_at": 149.72,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}She's done it. Just about did enough there, Paolini.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N她做到了 帕奥利尼惊险拿下"
    },
    {
      "start": 151.57999999999998,
      "end": 153.48,
      "film_at": 152.52,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}That was a struggle at times,{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N她有时打得很艰难"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.48,
      "end": 157.62,
      "film_at": 155.56,
      "subtitle_bottom": "480",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}but the fast start good enough for her when she led four-love.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N四比零的快速开局给了她优势"
    },
    {
      "start": 158.76,
      "end": 161.4,
      "film_at": 160.08,
      "subtitle_bottom": "480",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Bejlek showed real resistance from there on in,{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N贝莱克此后展现顽强抵抗"
    },
    {
      "start": 161.4,
      "end": 163.68,
      "film_at": 162.56,
      "subtitle_bottom": "480",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}but Paolini takes it six-three.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N但帕奥利尼六比三拿下"
    },
    {
      "start": 163.89,
      "end": 165.73,
      "film_at": 164.8,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}第二盘换了风向"
    },
    {
      "start": 165.73,
      "end": 167.97,
      "film_at": 166.84,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}贝莱克从底线不断压回球来"
    },
    {
      "start": 167.97,
      "end": 170.9,
      "film_at": 169.44,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}帕奥利尼还得重新稳住发球"
    },
    {
      "start": 182.74,
      "end": 187.3,
      "film_at": 185.04,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Oh, wonderful work from Paolini. She's so quick.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N帕奥利尼处理精彩 速度真快"
    },
    {
      "start": 187.94,
      "end": 194.21,
      "film_at": 191.08,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Big chance now for Bejlek. Paolini's second serve in particular has been brittle.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N贝莱克有机会 帕奥利尼二发脆弱"
    },
    {
      "start": 203.76,
      "end": 206.76,
      "film_at": 205.28,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Beautifully played, and it's been coming.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N打得漂亮 这一刻早已有了征兆"
    },
    {
      "start": 206.89,
      "end": 208.8,
      "film_at": 207.84,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}贝莱克拿到{\\fs78}3{\\fs68}比{\\fs78}1{\\fs68}"
    },
    {
      "start": 208.8,
      "end": 211.37,
      "film_at": 210.08,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}帕奥利尼又面对两次破发点"
    },
    {
      "start": 211.37,
      "end": 213.39,
      "film_at": 212.4,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}这一局必须守住"
    },
    {
      "start": 217.28,
      "end": 222.24,
      "film_at": 219.76,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Well, that's better. That's a bit more bite to the forehand from Paolini.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N好多了 帕奥利尼正手更有威力"
    },
    {
      "start": 222.89,
      "end": 224.64,
      "film_at": 223.76,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}帕奥利尼没有退"
    },
    {
      "start": 224.64,
      "end": 227.72,
      "film_at": 226.16,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}她先回破 再救回自己的发球局"
    },
    {
      "start": 227.72,
      "end": 229.46,
      "film_at": 228.6,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}从{\\fs78}1{\\fs68}比{\\fs78}3{\\fs68}追到{\\fs78}3{\\fs68}比{\\fs78}3{\\fs68}"
    },
    {
      "start": 229.46,
      "end": 231.48,
      "film_at": 230.48,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}反扑还没有结束"
    },
    {
      "start": 240.74,
      "end": 242.9,
      "film_at": 241.84,
      "subtitle_bottom": "306",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Well, Bejlek's looking at the line.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N贝莱克在看那条边线"
    },
    {
      "start": 253.0,
      "end": 256.78,
      "film_at": 254.88,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Well watched. Oh, that's a huge point saved there.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N判断很好 救下这关键一分"
    },
    {
      "start": 257.94,
      "end": 261.7,
      "film_at": 259.84,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Ten taken. Will this be the eleventh?{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N已拿下十次 这会是第十一次吗？"
    },
    {
      "start": 261.79,
      "end": 264.35,
      "film_at": 263.08,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fs78}4{\\fs68}比{\\fs78}3{\\fs68}又被追回{\\fs78}4{\\fs68}比{\\fs78}4{\\fs68}"
    },
    {
      "start": 264.35,
      "end": 265.96,
      "film_at": 265.16,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}帕奥利尼再次破发"
    },
    {
      "start": 265.96,
      "end": 268.8,
      "film_at": 267.36,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}把机会带进自己的发球局"
    },
    {
      "start": 271.94,
      "end": 273.52,
      "film_at": 272.72,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Paolini then back in front.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N帕奥利尼重新取得领先"
    },
    {
      "start": 283.02,
      "end": 285.52,
      "film_at": 284.28,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
      "text": "{\\an2}{\\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\\b0\\fs44\\bord2.5\\fsp0.6}Took too many liberties there, Bejlek.{\\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\\b1\\fs68\\bord4\\fsp0}\\N贝莱克这一下打得太冒险了"
    },
    {
      "start": 305.8,
      "end": 307.7,
      "film_at": 306.76,
      "subtitle_bottom": "360",
